# src/apps/daemon/internal/platform/windows

## Purpose
Contains Windows-specific daemon platform integration that cannot be expressed through portable foundation or platform abstractions.

## Contents
Contains Go code guarded or intended for Windows facilities such as system configuration, process/service, networking, or OS handles.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed through daemon platform boundaries and depends on Windows APIs and platform-specific libraries.

## Invariants
Windows-only code remains build-scoped to Windows, native handles/resources have explicit cleanup, privilege-sensitive mutations report failures, and rollback/cleanup preserves prior system state when operations cannot complete.